      "message": "Can we remove the EBADR exemption here so a missing ObjectMapper D-Bus object is reported as an internal error rather than treated as a missing Asset interface?\n\n```suggestion\n        if (ec.value() \u003d\u003d boost::system::errc::io_error)\n```",
