      "writtenOn": "2026-11-24T17:07:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "A missing Asset Interface should not be a internal error. \n\nI don\u0027t love that we exclude all io_error because that is things like xyz.openbmc_project.Common.Error.ResourceNotFound (valid to not throw an error) and org.freedesktop.DBus.Error.IOError (seems like that should be a 500) \n\nhttps://github.com/openbmc/phosphor-objmgr/blob/master/src/handler.cpp?utm_source\u003dchatgpt.com#L55\n\nI think we can remove EBADR  - maps to things like org.freedesktop.DBus.Error.UnknownObject\norg.freedesktop.DBus.Error.UnknownInterface\norg.freedesktop.DBus.Error.UnknownMethod\n\nBecause would hit ResourceNotFound / IOError if that interface doesn\u0027t exist \nBut you should test that..",
